       $notes_md$Networks and transformers briefly; tokens and embeddings properly, because the rest of the course is built on them.$notes_md$,
       $notes_md$The last of the overview lessons, and the one that connects to everything
after it. Deep learning gets a page; NLP gets a page; **embeddings** get the
